findings.claim:
For a known pair, a KB-first serve could skip every leg that depends only on product identity:
- the unified search, and the specs and reviews LLM calls (about 12 + 10 s of chain);
- smart fallback and Tier 2/3 (up to 12 s of serial tail);
- the image (5 s);
- the rating Serper call (4 s);
- category resolution.
All of these carry identity-keyed TTLs of 7-30 days today, which supports storing them per product in the KB.
